 r←Test_AskNumber_002(stopFlag batchFlag);globalParms;parms;value;⎕TRAP;okFlag
⍝ Exercise the "Create" method with a complex and valid definition. "OK" is pressed automatically.
 r←∆Failed
 ⎕TRAP←(999 'C' '. ⍝ Deliberate error')(0 'N')

 globalParms←#.APLGUI.APLGUI.APLGuiGlobalParms.CreateDefaults
 globalParms.regKey←'MyApp\Kai1'
 globalParms.testMode←1
 globalParms.caption←0⊃⎕XSI
 globalParms.icon←⎕NEW'Icon'(⊂'File'(GetFile'Sample.ico'))

 parms←#.APLGUI.APLGUI.Request.CreateParmsForNumber
 parms.addToCaption←'My request'
 parms.question←'Please enter number of copies:' '(4 are suggested)'
 parms.posn←50 1050
 parms.default←4
 parms.length←100
 parms.maxLength←140
 parms.hasHelpBtn←1
 parms.onHelp←'#.APLGUI.TestCases.∆OnShowMsg'
 parms.validIfEmpty←0
 parms.timeout←0.1

 (okFlag value)←globalParms parms #.APLGUI.APLGUI.Request.AskForNumber''
 →FailsIf 1≠okFlag
 →FailsIf 4≠value

 r←∆OK
